# ── portal e2e (Playwright) — the control-plane is FastAPI ──────────────────
# The former single-container Express e2e harness (scripts/e2e-container.sh,
# scripts/e2e-setup.sh) was removed with the Express backend. The portal is now
# a static React/Vite SPA; e2e specs run against the FastAPI control-plane, and
# backend/session fixtures are minted via backend/mint_dev_session.py.
# Only the QA test identity remains here — all Mongo/Cosmos/object-store/JWT
# server config moved to the FastAPI backend (backend/.env.example).
#
# Copy to .env.e2e (GITIGNORED) and fill the secrets.
E2E_QA_EMAIL=<qa-user-email>
E2E_QA_PASSWORD=<qa-user-password>
